  <item>
    <title>4.侯佩岑：真的吗，周杰伦？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66587b2394977a26ef0aebb6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66587b2394977a26ef0aebb6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 May 2024 13:12:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1C82LGEIHHW-NPljK3KTMICl0y.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期节目讲述的是周杰伦与侯佩岑的恋情，以及侯佩岑的个人经历和职业成就。侯佩岑以其高情商和专业能力在主持界获得认可，与周杰伦的恋情虽以分手告终，但周杰伦的多首歌曲被认为是写给她的，两人的互动充满了甜蜜和遗憾。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a>侯佩岑公开表达支持两岸统一的立场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">04:34</a>周杰伦与侯佩岑的恋情回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a>侯佩岑的家世背景与职业生涯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">08:57</a>侯主播的公众形象与情商</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a>侯佩岑动提出分手以保护自己，分手后两人仍有交集，在公共场合的表现体现了成熟处理前任关系的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a>周杰伦在某些场合下表现出对侯佩岑的关注和未完全释怀的情感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a>周杰伦四上侯佩岑的节目，暧昧的氛围溢满屏幕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a>为什么侯佩岑对于周杰伦来说是圈外人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a>周侯恋结束的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a>可爱女人和还好先生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">25:09</a>下一首歌就写给你，周杰伦音乐中的情感投射</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a>圣诞节快乐，愿你比我幸福，比我快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2076">34:36</a>昆凌与彩虹图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2153">35:53</a>你说你会哭，不是因为在乎</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《屋顶》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我不配》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《可爱女人》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《最长的电影》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——周杰伦</span></p>]]></description>
